1. ./build.sh v1
2. ./push_to_artifactory.sh v1
3. Change src/app.py:
return {"ok": "v1"} -> return {"ok": "v2"}

3. ./build.sh v2
4. ./build.sh v2

5. ./install.sh v1
6. ./install.sh v2

7. kubectl get service

8. Enter to pod and check services with curl:
kubectl run curl-test --image=curlimages/curl -it --rm -- sh
> curl http://<SERVICE-1-IP>
> curl http://<SERVICE-2-IP>

9. Apply gateway
cd gatewayclass
./apply-gateway.sh 

10. kubectl get gateway
Example:
NAME              CLASS                            ADDRESS         PROGRAMMED   AGE
uvicorn-gateway   gke-l7-global-external-managed   136.69.22.221   True         103s

11. Apply httprouter
./apply-httprouter.sh

12. kubectl describe httproute uvicorn-route

13. cd gatewayclass/testing
./distribute.sh <GATEWAY_IP>

14. Check results
Example:
91 {"ok":"v1"}
9 {"ok":"v2"}
